    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Area Attack.</strong> Each creature in a 3 squares cone rolls <strong>Guard</strong> vs DC 14. Hit: <code>2d12</code> kinetic (battlefield-impact) + violence; half on success. The guard plants and sweeps. Failed-save targets are knocked prone and pushed 2 squares away from the warlord (the cone always opens away from the warlord).<br/><em>Recharges on a Soma Break.</em></p><p><em>Whatever ground the warlord is standing on. That ground.</em></p>",
